WEBVTT

00:01:28.538 --> 00:01:30.744
and it has so many bad habits.

00:01:30.768 --> 00:01:35.085
I didn't know how a 15-year-old
was supposed to change anything,

00:01:35.109 --> 00:01:36.402
but I had to try.

00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:39.317
To put this philosophy into practice,

00:01:39.341 --> 00:01:41.895
I joined the environmental club
at my high school.

00:01:41.919 --> 00:01:46.588
However, I noticed that my classmates
were talking about recycling

00:01:46.612 --> 00:01:48.509
and watching movies about the ocean.

00:01:48.947 --> 00:01:51.362
It was a view of environmentalism

00:01:51.386 --> 00:01:55.839
that was so catered towards
an ineffective way of climate activism,

00:01:55.863 --> 00:01:59.279
one that blames the consumer
for the climate crisis

00:01:59.303 --> 00:02:01.839
and preaches that
temperatures are going up